  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\nWhat would you like to see in Matrix? If your idea is vaguely complete enough, we\r\nrecommend submitting [an MSC](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/proposals) instead.\r\n\r\nCurrently, Matrix only allows to know when our message arrived to our homeserver. However, it would be desirable to know the following:\r\n\r\n- Whether message arrived to the recipient's homeserver\r\n- Whether message arrived to the recipient's device\r\n- (The already possible, our homeserver)\r\n\r\nThis could maybe be implemented with state events, by making the recipient homeserver and device send those state events to a room (and all of its participants).\r\nAn MSC is outside of my capabilities i'm afraid.\r\n\r\nInspired by: https://github.com/vector-im/element-meta/issues/328\r\n",
